  *           @arg PWR_WAKEUP_PIN2 available only on STM32F410xx/STM32F446xx/STM32F412xx/STM32F413xx/STM32F423xx devices
  *           @arg PWR_WAKEUP_PIN3 available only on STM32F410xx/STM32F412xx/STM32F413xx/STM32F423xx devices
